OL,3,AAnthropic heads for $1.3 trillion
OL,4,Avaluation in major stock market listing
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic, the AI company behind the
OL,7,FClaude chatbot, could be valued at $1.3
OL,8,Ftrillion (#1 trillion) when it lists
OL,9,Fits shares for sale on New York's
OL,10,FNasdaq stock exchange.
OL,12,FThe loss-making company says it will
OL,13,Foffer its shares for between $70 and
OL,14,F$78 each and plans to raise up to $64bn
OL,15,Fwhen it floats this month.
OL,17,FThis would value Anthropic at between
OL,18,F$1.1 trillion and $1.3 trillion which,
OL,19,Falthough large, is below the $2
OL,20,Ftrillion some analysts had predicted
OL,21,Fweeks ago.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
